# CVEs accepted for the published Tennisfolio images.
#
# The release workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml) fails on HIGH/CRITICAL
# findings that have a fix available; unfixed CVEs are reported but don't block
# a release. Add an entry here only when a fixable finding is genuinely not
# exploitable for us, with a one-line reason and a link, e.g.
#
#   # CVE-2024-0000 — only reachable via the CLI entrypoint, which we don't ship.
#   CVE-2024-0000
#
# Keep this file empty otherwise: an unexplained exception is a silent
# regression in what we're telling users they can trust.
